<workflow>
  <name>mysql-bulk-file-and-load</name>
  <name_sync_with_filename>Y</name_sync_with_filename>
  <description/>
  <extended_description/>
  <created_user>-</created_user>
  <modified_user>-</modified_user>
  <created_date>2026/10/07 10:00:00.000</created_date>
  <modified_date>2026/10/07 10:00:00.000</modified_date>
  <created_hop_version/>
  <modified_hop_version/>
  <workflow_version/>
  <parameters/>
  <actions>
    <action>
      <repeat>N</repeat>
      <schedulerType>0</schedulerType>
      <intervalSeconds>0</intervalSeconds>
      <intervalMinutes>60</intervalMinutes>
      <DayOfMonth>1</DayOfMonth>
      <weekDay>1</weekDay>
      <minutes>0</minutes>
      <hour>12</hour>
      <doNotWaitOnFirstExecution>N</doNotWaitOnFirstExecution>
      <name>Start</name>
      <description/>
      <type>SPECIAL</type>
      <attributes/>
      <xloc>80</xloc>
      <yloc>400</yloc>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <attributes_hac/>
    </action>
    <action>
      <tablename>customers</tablename>
      <schemaname/>
      <filename>/tmp/customers.csv</filename>
      <separator>,</separator>
      <enclosed>"</enclosed>
      <lineterminated>\n</lineterminated>
      <limitlines>0</limitlines>
      <listcolumn/>
      <highpriority>N</highpriority>
      <optionenclosed>Y</optionenclosed>
      <outdumpvalue>0</outdumpvalue>
      <iffileexists>0</iffileexists>
      <addfiletoresult>N</addfiletoresult>
      <connection>mysql</connection>
      <name>Export customers</name>
      <description/>
      <type>MYSQL_BULK_FILE</type>
      <attributes/>
      <xloc>272</xloc>
      <yloc>400</yloc>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <attributes_hac/>
    </action>
    <action>
      <schemaname/>
      <tablename>customers_copy</tablename>
      <filename>${PROJECT_HOME}/files/customers.csv</filename>
      <separator>,</separator>
      <enclosed>"</enclosed>
      <escaped>\\</escaped>
      <linestarted/>
      <lineterminated>\n</lineterminated>
      <ignorelines>1</ignorelines>
      <replacedata>Y</replacedata>
      <listattribut/>
      <localinfile>Y</localinfile>
      <prorityvalue>0</prorityvalue>
      <addfiletoresult>N</addfiletoresult>
      <connection>mysql</connection>
      <name>Load customers_copy</name>
      <description/>
      <type>MYSQL_BULK_LOAD</type>
      <attributes/>
      <xloc>464</xloc>
      <yloc>400</yloc>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <attributes_hac/>
    </action>
    <action>
      <loglevel>Basic</loglevel>
      <logsubject/>
      <logmessage>customers exported, customers_copy loaded.</logmessage>
      <name>Done</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <xloc>656</xloc>
      <yloc>400</yloc>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <attributes_hac/>
    </action>
  </actions>
  <hops>
    <hop>
      <from>Start</from>
      <to>Export customers</to>
      <evaluation>Y</evaluation>
      <unconditional>Y</unconditional>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Export customers</from>
      <to>Load customers_copy</to>
      <evaluation>Y</evaluation>
      <unconditional>N</unconditional>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Load customers_copy</from>
      <to>Done</to>
      <evaluation>Y</evaluation>
      <unconditional>N</unconditional>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
  </hops>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>The MySQL bulk file action exports a table to a file with SELECT ... INTO OUTFILE. The file is written by the database server, on the database server.
The MySQL bulk load action loads a file into a table with LOAD DATA [LOCAL] INFILE. With the "Local" option the file is read from the machine running Hop.

This sample exports the table customers to /tmp/customers.csv on the database server, and loads ${PROJECT_HOME}/files/customers.csv into the table customers_copy.</note>
      <markdown>N</markdown>
      <notetype>GENERAL</notetype>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>14</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>58</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>90</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>201</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>232</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>251</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>14</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>58</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>90</bordercolorblue>
      <xloc>80</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>736</width>
      <height>156</height>
    </notepad>
    <notepad>
      <note>Requires setup: this sample needs a MySQL database and a relational database connection called "mysql" in the project metadata,
the customers and customers_copy tables, and the database user needs the FILE privilege. Create those before running this sample.
This sample is excluded from the samples integration tests.</note>
      <markdown>N</markdown>
      <notetype>GENERAL</notetype>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>110</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>50</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>255</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>220</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>180</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>230</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>126</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>34</bordercolorblue>
      <xloc>80</xloc>
      <yloc>204</yloc>
      <width>736</width>
      <height>110</height>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
  <attributes/>
</workflow>
